This repository contains deployment files for SIPMediaGW
(https://github.com/Renater/SIPMediaGW), developed by RENATER and licensed under
the Apache License 2.0. These files are copied from SIPMediaGW or derived from it:

- assets/gateway/IVR/index.html: derived from browsing/assets/IVR/index.html (loads edumeet.css)
- assets/proxy/brand.js: derived from deploy/proxyAPI/brand.js (service name and accent colour changed)
- central/proxy.env.example: derived from deploy/proxyAPI/.env
- gateway-host/sipmediagw.env: derived from .env (see the header of the file)
- gateway-host/start.sh: derived from deploy/services/start_all_gateways.bash
  (see the header of the file)

The branding comes from edumeet-client (https://github.com/edumeet/edumeet-client):
assets/gateway/IVR/logo.svg is the light eduMEET logo, assets/proxy/favicon.svg
contains the eduMEET app icon, and the colours in assets/gateway/IVR/edumeet.css and
assets/proxy/brand.js are the client theme defaults.

assets/gateway/IVR/platform_en.mp3 and assets/gateway/IVR/conference_en.mp3 are made
with Piper and the voice en_GB-alba-medium, licensed under CC BY 4.0: dataset
https://datashare.ed.ac.uk/handle/10283/3270, base model trained on the NVIDIA
Hi-Fi TTS dataset.
